          "bbox": [
            0.269,
            0.296,
            0.65,
            0.346
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Why were the type ‘B’ cuttings able to grow as sugarcane but type ‘A’ could not?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.264,
            0.347,
            0.649,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) What difference was present in type ‘B’ compared to type ‘A’?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.259,
            0.381,
            0.65,
            0.431
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) What observation or measurement was made to determine whether this change had an effect?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
